    "title": "",
    "legend": "Vascularity. A variety of vessel types and sizes constitute angiofibroma, with circumferential smooth muscle, pads of smooth muscle, and a complete lack of smooth muscle around the vessels. The stroma shows increased cellularity and collagen deposition.",
